{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FLIPSIDE IS GOING TO FLIP YOUR WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, a relaxing 2D platformer game that is going to flip the world of everyone who plays with the keyboard and a couple of fingers.<i>  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/94131c3380b05c352e14b52e185857f7.poster.avif?t=1769547630\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/94131c3380b05c352e14b52e185857f7.webm?t=1769547630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/94131c3380b05c352e14b52e185857f7.mp4?t=1769547630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD FULL OF MIND-BENDING ROOMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world full of different, progressive, and sometimes head-spinning rooms, Flipside stands out as a game that needs to be in the library of every level-headed gamer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/faea38618f26040b265b5b98b3f54547.poster.avif?t=1769547630\" width=796 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/faea38618f26040b265b5b98b3f54547.webm?t=1769547630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/faea38618f26040b265b5b98b3f54547.mp4?t=1769547630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RETRO AND MODERN MEETS IN THE PIXEL WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Retro visuals combine with modern design as they make you feel nostalgic and make exploring every single level a pleasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/97a9a4e42f1c1294561eae4b0c3a9ccc.poster.avif?t=1769547630\" width=800 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/97a9a4e42f1c1294561eae4b0c3a9ccc.webm?t=1769547630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/97a9a4e42f1c1294561eae4b0c3a9ccc.mp4?t=1769547630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT'S IN THE GAME? MAYBE THERE IS A LOT MORE BUT LET'S LIST: </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 head-spinning levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nicely designed graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameboy Color Palette!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confusing flipping levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret paths, hidden levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of achievements and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/c19d1128b3a254a7fcf80e4fda4d38e6.poster.avif?t=1769547630\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/c19d1128b3a254a7fcf80e4fda4d38e6.webm?t=1769547630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921160/extras/c19d1128b3a254a7fcf80e4fda4d38e6.mp4?t=1769547630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOR LAZY PEOPLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you said, &quot;Too Long, Didn't Read&quot;, simply this game literally flips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"New Perspective!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921160/9069ae57ef2d293849ffd6f9b5bcd7bc2a7661ea.jpg"},{"name":"World Turner!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921160/71d86c5ae0bf18843a27513cb72bd4ba7ea690be.jpg"},{"name":"Warming Up!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921160/ca1d30fda7254d2444fe6ec526527c35723981d7.jpg"},{"name":"Defying Gravity!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921160/483591c2d5ab0ff4a39cb146dc773282fac1301a.jpg"},{"name":"Off the Map!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921160/f279fbf9a05e05c344c7b2c997777bd0ca44f7e3.jpg"},{"name":"Dude!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921160/65bdc05b2a4cc8e55c04eb7fe35a852ffbaa8e23.jpg"},{"name":"I'll Do It Myself!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921160/433af2338bc76c57744b3c3452a0a4e58423525a.jpg"},{"name":"Glutton for Punishment!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921160/3cd8171817e50af40cbd07de4a7fc6f5ea94f9bf.jpg"},{"name":"First of Many!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921160/ad746876cfa95a4367df6f932bbd7e97db117fc6.jpg"},{"name":"Secret to Success!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921160/7b41c9ee3cf1092b10dd58f027e8ead3957ae203.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921160?t=1769547630","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/39211